      "content": "REST API for the Hibachi stablecoin-native perpetual futures and FX exchange. Provides public market data plus authenticated account, trading, and capital (deposit/withdraw/transfer) operations. Most endpoints require an API key in the Authorization header; order, withdrawal, and transfer operations additionally require a cryptographic signature (ECDSA for trustless accounts, HMAC for exchange-managed accounts). Converted faithfully from Hibachi's published public Postman collection.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Hibachi",
